expression: "dump_source(\"def max<T: Comparable>(a: T, b: T): T\\n  if a > b then a else b end\\nend\")"
---
FuncDef max<T: Comparable>(a, b)
  If
    cond
      Binary(>)
        Ident(a)
        Ident(b)
    then
      Ident(a)
    else
      Ident(b)
